form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>People are extremely friendly in this world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/a94df74311e333522389c3d4ac0b18c7.poster.avif?t=1772210508\" width=660 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/a94df74311e333522389c3d4ac0b18c7.webm?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/a94df74311e333522389c3d4ac0b18c7.mp4?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/070d04b8ed09262c6aeeb5bd4bd29f95.webp?t=1772210508\" width=256 height=44 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hold down the left mouse button to aim where you want to send the bomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Release the left mouse button to fire the bomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hold down the right mouse button to control the power of the explosion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Release the right mouse button to trigger the explosion or hold down the right click until maximum power is reached.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Pretty simple, right?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/8353bfb8f34be5e7aa5c207207770831.poster.avif?t=1772210508\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/8353bfb8f34be5e7aa5c207207770831.webm?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/8353bfb8f34be5e7aa5c207207770831.mp4?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/0de58afc884614709c740d9991b5e36a.webp?t=1772210508\" width=200 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A colorful pixel art universe and a medieval fantasy setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/f2aa399402ee38ec65597ce6c2dc0b29.avif?t=1772210508\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/d4176c8352ab334b6573af1c4b19e97a.webp?t=1772210508\" width=224 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It seems that stylish outfits are hiding everywhere...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/cc70e1674fe2fb10a922d3fe572adb2a.poster.avif?t=1772210508\" width=168 height=177 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/cc70e1674fe2fb10a922d3fe572adb2a.webm?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/b2c6f6e706ef009f7bb300f615dacb2e.webp?t=1772210508\" width=280 height=52 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If, after completing the game and its various possible endings, you still want more, there are specific challenges remaining in each area of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Pssst... this is for experts. :)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/e972124f5a1bd38b49dc49891cd1d1dd.avif?t=1772210508\" width=432 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/766eb5227b06ceb04ffb35168d9546f2.webp?t=1772210508\" width=240 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On your marks, get set, fall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/fe218f37db7cf10004cb9dad0e516894.poster.avif?t=1772210508\" width=562 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/fe218f37db7cf10004cb9dad0e516894.webm?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/fe218f37db7cf10004cb9dad0e516894.mp4?t=1772210508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642650/extras/bdd267a477c65e113f0db6cfa854b15e.webp?t=1772210508\" width=216 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game is inspired by the famous <strong><u>“Jump King” by Nexile</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explosion animation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ansimuz explosion-animations-pack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trailer music: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Take a Chance&quot; Kevin MacLeod (incompetech)</strong></p>",
